<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Primedia says in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Primedia says in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African advertising and publishing firm Primedia Ltd said on Thursday that it is involved in various negotiations which, if successfully concluded, could affect its share price.</p>
<p>The firm warned shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in its stock until a further announcement is made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
